# Trivy misconfiguration findings allowed with justification.
#
# KSV053 (Exec into Pods): the Tailscale serve watcher needs pods/exec
# create to run `tailscale serve` on Tailscale-managed proxy pods. The Role
# is namespaced to tailscale and the watcher script filters pods by the
# tailscale.com/managed=true label. Checkov covers the same file and the
# Deployment itself passes all workload hardening checks.
KSV053
